    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dan Scarfe’s grandfather has a hearing problem. At a big family "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gathering",
            "ref": "v-gathering"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " last Christmas, Dan noticed his grandfather sitting alone. The old man couldn’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the conversations and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "felt left out",
            "ref": "v-feel-left-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This made Dan sad. He thought, “My grandpa uses "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "captions",
            "zh": "字幕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to watch TV. Why can’t we have captions for real-life "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dan decided to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He worked with his team for about half a year to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "solution",
            "ref": "v-solution"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": XRAI smart glasses. These special glasses help people with hearing loss “read” conversations."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Here is how they "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The glasses are connected to a smartphone. A small "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "microphone",
            "zh": "麦克风"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the glasses "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "audio",
            "zh": "音频"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the person you are talking to. This audio is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the phone. A special app on the phone then turns the spoken words into text. Finally, the captions "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lenses",
            "zh": "镜片"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the glasses "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "in real time",
            "ref": "v-in-real-time"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You can use them for face-to-face chats or phone calls. The words appear as white text, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the user to see what is being said and respond quickly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dan’s company began selling the glasses, and they quickly became "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Users find them life-changing. One user "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", “I can keep up with my friends’ conversations much better now. I feel more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "involved",
            "ref": "v-involved"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " than ever before!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Thanks to Dan’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " idea, his grandfather and many others can now "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " every conversation. This technology is truly making a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in people’s lives. The glasses have brought "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "connection",
            "ref": "v-connection"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to many families."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
